(LEGAL-015 - OPERATIVE CLAUSES & STATUTORY DIRECTIVES \(PAGE 2\)) Tj T*
(Title: G.O. \(Ms\) No. 214, Public Works Department  Revised Flood Regulation Curve) Tj T*
(Addressed / Competent Officer: Executive Engineer, Kosasthalaiyar / Palar Basin Division \(WRD\) & Collector Kancheepuram) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 1: Clause 2.1 \(Rule Curve & Pre-Release Notification\)) Tj T*
(Mandates continuous monitoring of catchment rainfall, inflow \(cusecs\), and) Tj T*
(water-spread storage in Chembarambakkam Tank \(Full Capacity 3,645 Mcft / 24.0 ft\),) Tj T*
(with mandatory prior intimation to Kancheepuram, Chengalpattu, and Greater Chennai) Tj T*
(Collectors before opening surplus shutters.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(CLAUSE 2: Clause 5.3 \(Protection of Upstream Supply Channels\)) Tj T*
(All upstream feeder channels from Sriperumbudur, Pillaipakkam, and Nemili tanks) Tj T*
(leading into Chembarambakkam must be kept clear of industrial or residential) Tj T*
(obstructions prior to October 15th each year.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
